            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Сделай акцент на словах во втором предложении.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"101\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"My party gets nervous when the boss music starts. \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"I guess it's time\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" to dodge-roll a lot.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>&lt;em&gt;</code>, а затем <code>&lt;/em&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
